Biela looks exactly like the dark one: on a black background a glowing, skeleton-like animal with long curved horns is shown — a deer skeleton in a glitch/neon style: visible are the skull, cervical and thoracic vertebrae, ribs and part of the front leg. Colors are cool neon (cyan, white, slight purple); the image is grainy and distorted.